---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About — Photo Print Tool"
  description="About Photo Print Tool — a free, browser-based passport photo and ID card layout tool. No uploads, no signup, fully private."
>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="header-inner">
      <a href="/" class="header-brand">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" width="28" height="28"><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="13" rx="2" stroke="#F5AE0A" stroke-width="1.8"/><circle cx="12" cy="14" r="3.4" stroke="#F5AE0A" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M8 7l1.2-2.5h5.6L16 7" stroke="#F5AE0A" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg>
        <span>Photo Print Tool</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="header-actions">
        <a href="/" class="header-btn">Tool</a>
        <a href="/about" class="header-btn">About</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="header-btn">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-inner">
      <h1>About Photo Print Tool</h1>

      <h2>What It Is</h2>
      <p>Photo Print Tool is a free, browser-based application for arranging passport photos, ID cards, and stamp-size photos on A4 pages for printing or PDF export. It handles common Indian document sizes (Aadhar, PAN, Voter ID, Driving License) as well as US Visa photos and custom dimensions.</p>

      <h2>Why It Exists</h2>
      <p>Getting passport photos or ID card copies printed used to mean visiting a photo studio or using clunky desktop software. Photo Print Tool makes this process instant: upload your photos, pick the size, and print or save as PDF — all from your browser, with no software installation.</p>

      <h2>Privacy First</h2>
      <p>Every photo you upload is processed entirely inside your browser. Nothing is ever sent to a server. This is especially important for identity documents — your photos stay on your device at all times.</p>

      <h2>Who Built It</h2>
      <p>Photo Print Tool was built by a developer focused on making practical, privacy-first web utilities. The tool is open and free to use with no restrictions.</p>

      <h2>Technology</h2>
      <p>Built with Astro, Tailwind CSS, and vanilla JavaScript. No frameworks, no heavy libraries — just fast, reliable code that runs in any modern browser on desktop or mobile.</p>

      <h2>Open and Free</h2>
      <p>The tool is completely free with no limits, no watermarks, and no sign-up required. You can use it as many times as you need.</p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <nav class="footer-links">
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>
        <a href="/about">About</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
      <p>Photo Print Tool — Free, private, browser-based. No uploads, no accounts.</p>
      <p class="footer-sub">Built with Astro. All processing happens locally in your browser.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
